// 1. for each layer $\ell$: $z_\ell \leftarrow \mathrm{BN}_\ell(\sum_v h^{(\ell)}_v)$
// 2. context $c \leftarrow \mathrm{MEAN}_{v\in G}\, x_v$;\; centered $\tilde x_v \leftarrow x_v - c_{\text{batch}(v)}$
// 3. degree feats: $\log(1+d_v)$ and $d_v - \mathrm{MEAN}_G(d)$
// 4. node gate $\alpha_v \leftarrow \sigma(\mathrm{MLP}([x_v, c_{\text{batch}(v)}, \log(1+d_v), d_v - \bar d]))$, normalized so $\sum_{v\in G} \alpha_v = 1$
// 5. saliency $s_G \leftarrow \mathrm{LN}(\,[\sum_v \alpha_v \tilde x_v;\; \sqrt{\sum_v \alpha_v \tilde x_v^{\odot 2}}\,])$
// 6. modulators $m \leftarrow 1 + 0.1\,\tanh(W_{\text{mod}}\,s_G)$ with $W_{\text{mod}}$ near-zero init
// 7. return $\big[\, m_1 z_1 \,\Vert\, \dots \,\Vert\, m_L z_L \,\big]$
